WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.041 --> 00:00:31.583
<b>In the previous verse,</b>

2
00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:32.791
<b>Lord Krishna explained</b>

3
00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:38.083
<b>why did he have to come to revive this </b>
<b>spiritual knowledge of the Gita,</b>

4
00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:41.458
<b>in this era of Mahabharata.</b>

5
00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:42.291
<b>But</b>

6
00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:45.875
<b>now a natural question may arise</b>

7
00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:48.625
<b>that there were many people </b>
<b>in the Mahabharata era,</b>

8
00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:54.833
<b>so why did Lord Krishna choose </b>
<b>Arjuna for this knowledge?</b>

9
00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:58.416
<b>This verse is the answer to this very question.</b>

10
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:05.958
<b>In this verse, Lord Krishna says,</b>

11
00:01:05.958 --> 00:01:07.083
<b>Arjuna,</b>

12
00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:12.708
<b>I am now revealing this ancient</b>
<b>knowledge of yoga to you again,</b>

13
00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:13.666
<b>because</b>

14
00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:16.875
<b>you are my devotee as well as my friend.</b>

15
00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:18.000
<b>And yes,</b>

16
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.958
<b>this knowledge is the greatest </b>
<b>of all the mysteries of life.</b>

17
00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:25.250
<b>Let's understand this...</b>

18
00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:27.666
<b>Lord Krishna mentioned in the first verse</b>

19
00:01:27.666 --> 00:01:32.916
<b>how ancient, how primordial</b>
<b>this knowledge of the Gita is.</b>

20
00:01:32.916 --> 00:01:38.083
<b>This is the same knowledge that </b>
<b>he himself gave to the sun god Vivasvan,</b>

21
00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:41.791
<b>from where it reached mankind through Manu.</b>

22
00:01:41.791 --> 00:01:43.750
<b>But what is this knowledge?</b>

23
00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:46.625
<b>It is the knowledge of 'yoga'.</b>

24
00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:52.083
<b>Yoga means to join or unite.</b>

25
00:01:52.083 --> 00:01:53.708
<b>With this knowledge of yoga,</b>

26
00:01:53.708 --> 00:02:00.041
<b>the individual soul can establish its relationship </b>
<b>and itself with the Supreme Lord.</b>

27
00:02:00.041 --> 00:02:00.833
<b>But</b>

28
00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:03.875
<b>why was Arjuna chosen for this knowledge?</b>

29
00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:08.000
<b>Because he is both Krishna's friend and devotee.</b>

30
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.125
<b>Why are these two qualities necessary?</b>

31
00:02:11.125 --> 00:02:14.875
<b>A friend is one who understands </b>
<b>the state of the other's heart.</b>

32
00:02:14.875 --> 00:02:21.583
<b>A friend is one who knows that what </b>
<b>is being said to him is for his own good,</b>

33
00:02:21.583 --> 00:02:30.208
<b>and he accepts all these things not as an </b>
<b>order or instruction, but with love.</b>

34
00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:31.416
<b>And a devotee.</b>

35
00:02:31.416 --> 00:02:39.875
<b>A devotee is one who knows and believes that</b>
<b>he is small, a mere instrument in front of his Lord.</b>

36
00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:42.541
<b>And this devotional attitude is necessary,</b>

37
00:02:42.541 --> 00:02:45.416
<b>otherwise the mind, attached </b>
<b>to this material world,</b>

38
00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:51.000
<b>will create many doubts instead of </b>
<b>understanding things beyond this world.</b>

39
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.375
<b>To understand the supreme knowledge,</b>
<b>surrender is required, not doubt,</b>

40
00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:58.875
<b>which is a great power of a devotee.</b>

41
00:02:58.875 --> 00:03:00.083
<b>For this reason,</b>

42
00:03:00.083 --> 00:03:05.000
<b>both the love of friendship and </b>
<b>the surrender of devotion are necessary.</b>

43
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.000
<b>However,</b>

44
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.708
<b>Krishna also said that this is a secret.</b>

45
00:03:09.708 --> 00:03:11.541
<b>So if this is a secret,</b>

46
00:03:11.541 --> 00:03:15.541
<b>then why is this secret presented before all?</b>

47
00:03:15.541 --> 00:03:16.833
<b>Consider,</b>

48
00:03:16.833 --> 00:03:20.375
<b>if an expert has written a book,</b>

49
00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:27.708
<b>will we be able to understand that</b>
<b>subject as fully as that expert knows it?</b>

50
00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:29.041
<b>No, right?</b>

51
00:03:29.041 --> 00:03:30.125
<b>Now think,</b>

52
00:03:30.125 --> 00:03:36.083
<b>if that expert himself is in front of you, </b>
<b>can answer all your questions,</b>

53
00:03:36.083 --> 00:03:43.125
<b>and also wants to explain everything to you in its </b>
<b>original form due to friendship and love with you,</b>

54
00:03:43.125 --> 00:03:46.208
<b>then how much higher will be</b>
<b>the level of this knowledge,</b>

55
00:03:46.208 --> 00:03:49.000
<b>how much will its depth increase.</b>

56
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.791
<b>This knowledge is not a secret,</b>

57
00:03:50.791 --> 00:03:56.958
<b>but every fact, every depth behind this knowledge </b>
<b>is not understood by the ordinary man.</b>

58
00:03:56.958 --> 00:04:01.250
<b>Only some are fortunate enough to</b>
<b>have the source of that knowledge itself</b>

59
00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:06.375
<b>teach them every fact, take them to every depth.</b>

60
00:04:06.375 --> 00:04:08.458
<b>Understand it this way,</b>

61
00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:10.708
<b>the water of the ocean is not a secret,</b>

62
00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:15.583
<b>nor is it a secret that the ocean is very deep.</b>

63
00:04:15.583 --> 00:04:16.250
<b>But</b>

64
00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:27.416
<b>what all is in that depth will remain a mystery until</b>
<b>you descend to that depth with a special trainer.</b>

65
00:04:27.416 --> 00:04:29.875
<b>This good fortune is attained by Arjuna.</b>

66
00:04:29.875 --> 00:04:34.833
<b>Because the main source of this subject </b>
<b>is taking him to the depth himself.</b>

67
00:04:34.833 --> 00:04:38.416
<b>This knowledge of the Gita </b>
<b>is presented before all of us,</b>

68
00:04:38.416 --> 00:04:40.375
<b>if we continue on this path,</b>

69
00:04:40.375 --> 00:04:45.333
<b>we too will gradually be able to </b>
<b>know the mystery of its depth.</b>

70
00:04:45.333 --> 00:04:47.791
<b>Surrender is necessary for this,</b>

71
00:04:47.791 --> 00:04:50.708
<b>devotional attitude is necessary.</b>

72
00:04:55.166 --> 00:04:58.958
<b>To impart this sacred knowledge,</b>

73
00:04:58.958 --> 00:05:02.916
<b>I chose Arjuna</b>

74
00:05:02.916 --> 00:05:06.875
<b>because he has both humility </b>

75
00:05:06.875 --> 00:05:10.250
<b>and devotion.</b>

76
00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:14.125
<b>Not every knowledge is for everyone.</b>

77
00:05:14.125 --> 00:05:17.041
<b>Or rather,</b>

78
00:05:17.041 --> 00:05:20.541
<b>let me say that knowledge can </b>
<b>be shared with everyone,</b>

79
00:05:20.541 --> 00:05:25.666
<b>but not everyone will be able </b>
<b>to absorb it in equal measure.</b>

80
00:05:25.666 --> 00:05:32.083
<b>Only when there is complete faith </b>
<b>in the source of knowledge</b>

81
00:05:32.083 --> 00:05:37.541
<b>will one be able to understand the </b>
<b>deep mysteries of that knowledge.</b>

82
00:05:37.541 --> 00:05:39.666
<b>For example,</b>

83
00:05:39.666 --> 00:05:43.750
<b>when a child learns to ride a bicycle,</b>

84
00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:51.291
<b>it is usually the parents who teach this task.</b>

85
00:05:51.291 --> 00:05:53.250
<b>If someone else teaches,</b>

86
00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:59.875
<b>will that child learn with </b>
<b>as much faith, as quickly?</b>

87
00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:02.333
<b>Probably not.</b>

88
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:04.916
<b>But why?</b>

89
00:06:04.916 --> 00:06:09.375
<b>The quality of teaching cycling </b>
<b>was also with someone else.</b>

90
00:06:09.375 --> 00:06:14.250
<b>So why only parents?</b>

91
00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:18.875
<b>You also know the answer to this.</b>

92
00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:22.250
<b>Because as soon as the child </b>
<b>comes in front of the parents,</b>

93
00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:25.375
<b>the child's mind changes,</b>

94
00:06:25.375 --> 00:06:28.666
<b>faith awakens in that mind,</b>

95
00:06:28.666 --> 00:06:34.875
<b>and from this faith comes surrender,</b>

96
00:06:34.875 --> 00:06:41.375
<b>and with surrender, knowledge increases.</b>

97
00:06:41.375 --> 00:06:45.083
<b>Knowledge does not depend only on the giver.</b>

98
00:06:45.083 --> 00:06:50.666
<b>Knowledge also depends on</b>
<b>the mindset of the receiver,</b>

99
00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:52.125
<b>and</b>

100
00:06:52.125 --> 00:06:55.916
<b>Arjuna's mindset is appropriate.</b>

101
00:06:55.916 --> 00:07:01.750
<b>You can apply this in your personal life as well.   </b>

102
00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.041
<b>Whenever you learn something new,</b>

103
00:07:04.041 --> 00:07:07.000
<b>learn with complete surrender.</b>

104
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.000
<b>Yes,</b>

105
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.208
<b>questions may arise in the mind.</b>

106
00:07:11.208 --> 00:07:12.916
<b>But remember,</b>

107
00:07:12.916 --> 00:07:17.458
<b>there is a big difference </b>
<b>between doubt and questions.</b>

108
00:07:17.458 --> 00:07:23.416
<b>Doubt or suspicion cannot </b>
<b>be resolved with answers.</b>

109
00:07:23.416 --> 00:07:30.333
<b>Doubts arise when there is ego </b>
<b>in the mind that only I am right.</b>

110
00:07:30.333 --> 00:07:31.666
<b>But if,</b>

111
00:07:31.666 --> 00:07:35.041
<b>by giving up ego, if you surrender,</b>

112
00:07:35.041 --> 00:07:41.416
<b>then every question that arises in the</b>
<b>mind will definitely get an answer in time,</b>

113
00:07:41.416 --> 00:07:45.666
<b>and you will be able to understand</b>
<b>the depth of knowledge.</b>

114
00:07:45.666 --> 00:07:52.041
<b>And this is not limited only to </b>
<b>spiritual knowledge or this Gita.</b>

115
00:07:52.041 --> 00:07:54.083
<b>Whatever new you learn,</b>

116
00:07:54.083 --> 00:07:57.250
<b>learn with the mindset of a disciple.</b>

117
00:07:57.250 --> 00:08:00.791
<b>Ask questions, seek their answers.</b>

118
00:08:00.791 --> 00:08:02.500
<b>But</b>

119
00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:09.750
<b>keep in mind that the poison of ego and </b>
<b>doubt does not affect your mind.</b>

120
00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:13.666
<b>When you make yourself like this,</b>

121
00:08:13.666 --> 00:08:15.833
<b>then the deep truths of life,</b>

122
00:08:15.833 --> 00:08:22.708
<b>all the facts of this Gita will </b>
<b>start to make sense to you.</b>

123
00:08:22.708 --> 00:08:26.166
<b>I am ready to give this knowledge.</b>

124
00:08:26.166 --> 00:08:29.875
<b>Is the disciple within you ready?   </b>

125
00:08:29.875 --> 00:08:32.416
<b>To accept it?</b>

126
00:08:36.916 --> 00:08:38.875
<b>This knowledge of the Gita</b>

127
00:08:38.875 --> 00:08:42.625
<b>could not be given to everyone,</b>

128
00:08:42.625 --> 00:08:46.208
<b>only Arjuna was suitable for it.</b>

129
00:08:46.208 --> 00:08:47.166
<b>Because</b>

130
00:08:47.166 --> 00:08:51.375
<b>not everyone can understand </b>
<b>the depth of this knowledge,</b>

131
00:08:51.375 --> 00:08:54.500
<b>nor can they propagate it.</b>

132
00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:59.083
<b>This does not mean that it is some secret,</b>

133
00:08:59.083 --> 00:09:02.333
<b>it only means that</b>

134
00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:06.250
<b>even if the same words are told to everyone,</b>

135
00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.250
<b>but</b>

136
00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:11.916
<b>the mindset to find the</b>
<b>hidden secrets within them,</b>

137
00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:13.750
<b>that surrender,</b>

138
00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:16.583
<b>is found only in some.</b>

139
00:09:16.583 --> 00:09:22.291
<b>This also applies in the family and social context.</b>

140
00:09:22.291 --> 00:09:29.083
<b>Many times we want to share the </b>
<b>secrets of our mind with someone,</b>

141
00:09:29.083 --> 00:09:31.375
<b>we want to tell someone.</b>

142
00:09:31.375 --> 00:09:34.666
<b>The reason for this can be anything.</b>

143
00:09:34.666 --> 00:09:35.625
<b>Perhaps</b>

144
00:09:35.625 --> 00:09:39.333
<b>we are very distressed by something,</b>

145
00:09:39.333 --> 00:09:42.166
<b>we need a new perspective,</b>

146
00:09:42.166 --> 00:09:45.166
<b>or it may also be</b>

147
00:09:45.166 --> 00:09:53.125
<b>that we are so happy that there will be a </b>
<b>feeling of joy in sharing that thing with someone.</b>

148
00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:55.125
<b>Think.</b>

149
00:09:55.125 --> 00:10:03.208
<b>Even if it is within the family, </b>
<b>can this matter be shared with everyone?</b>

150
00:10:03.208 --> 00:10:06.000
<b>If it is a worrying matter,</b>

151
00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:12.750
<b>then it can be shared with the one who </b>
<b>is also your well-wisher from the heart,</b>

152
00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:19.250
<b>and at the same time is also mature </b>
<b>enough to understand this matter.</b>

153
00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:22.791
<b>And even if it is a joyous matter,</b>

154
00:10:22.791 --> 00:10:31.041
<b>then also you will share this with the </b>
<b>one who will himself be happy in your joy.</b>

155
00:10:31.041 --> 00:10:32.375
<b>Such people,</b>

156
00:10:32.375 --> 00:10:33.958
<b>like Arjuna,</b>

157
00:10:33.958 --> 00:10:36.083
<b>are your well-wishers,</b>

158
00:10:36.083 --> 00:10:37.750
<b>your friends.</b>

159
00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.083
<b>In the family,</b>

160
00:10:39.083 --> 00:10:40.625
<b>among relatives,</b>

161
00:10:40.625 --> 00:10:42.291
<b>or among friends,</b>

162
00:10:42.291 --> 00:10:45.750
<b>who are your Arjunas?</b>

163
00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.458
<b>These are the people</b>

164
00:10:47.458 --> 00:10:54.000
<b>who stood by you even in times of crisis,</b>

165
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:58.000
<b>always gave you good advice.</b>

166
00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:02.166
<b>These are the people who supported </b>
<b>you not for selfishness,</b>

167
00:11:02.166 --> 00:11:03.000
<b>but</b>

168
00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:06.166
<b>only for affection.</b>

169
00:11:06.166 --> 00:11:11.416
<b>These are the people who are </b>
<b>always delighted in your progress.</b>

170
00:11:11.416 --> 00:11:15.708
<b>Now here, age or relationship does not matter,</b>

171
00:11:15.708 --> 00:11:17.208
<b>these friends of yours,</b>

172
00:11:17.208 --> 00:11:18.791
<b>these Arjunas of yours,</b>

173
00:11:18.791 --> 00:11:21.458
<b>can be anyone.</b>

174
00:11:21.458 --> 00:11:23.166
<b>Your parents,</b>

175
00:11:23.166 --> 00:11:24.291
<b>siblings,</b>

176
00:11:24.291 --> 00:11:27.291
<b>a friend or a relative.</b>

177
00:11:27.291 --> 00:11:35.416
<b>Someone with whom you can safely </b>
<b>share your thoughts and feelings.</b>

178
00:11:35.416 --> 00:11:36.750
<b>Remember,</b>

179
00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:40.833
<b>this is not about keeping </b>
<b>things secret from others,</b>

180
00:11:40.833 --> 00:11:49.083
<b>it is about sharing the right thing, </b>
<b>in the right situation, with the right person.</b>

181
00:11:49.083 --> 00:11:52.541
<b>It's about respecting your thoughts,</b>

182
00:11:52.541 --> 00:11:57.750
<b>and sharing them only with those </b>
<b>who are worthy of such respect.</b>

183
00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.166
<b>Also,</b>

184
00:11:59.166 --> 00:12:06.041
<b>this understanding of yours will help </b>
<b>the younger ones in the family in two ways.</b>

185
00:12:06.041 --> 00:12:07.250
<b>First,</b>

186
00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:10.416
<b>they will learn to respect their thoughts</b>

187
00:12:10.416 --> 00:12:13.708
<b>and learn to differentiate </b>
<b>between people correctly.</b>

188
00:12:13.708 --> 00:12:15.333
<b>And second,</b>

189
00:12:15.333 --> 00:12:19.833
<b>they will be encouraged to</b>
<b>be well-wishers of others themselves.</b>

190
00:12:19.833 --> 00:12:20.750
<b>Because</b>

191
00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:29.666
<b>they will know that only selfless help</b>
<b>brings strength and sweetness in relationships.</b>

192
00:12:29.666 --> 00:12:36.125
<b>Such positive thinking is also a step in</b>
<b>building an excellent society.</b>

193
00:12:36.125 --> 00:12:37.708
<b>Think about it.</b>

194
00:12:42.541 --> 00:12:44.750
<b>Any deep knowledge,</b>

195
00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:47.208
<b>any important matter</b>

196
00:12:47.208 --> 00:12:52.916
<b>can be shared only with the </b>
<b>one who is sensitive towards it,</b>

197
00:12:52.916 --> 00:12:55.750
<b>like Arjuna is.</b>

198
00:12:55.750 --> 00:13:00.083
<b>It becomes very essential in the workplace also</b>

199
00:13:00.083 --> 00:13:07.833
<b>that you share your sensitive </b>
<b>information wisely with someone.</b>

200
00:13:07.833 --> 00:13:17.708
<b>Be it any strategy of that organization, </b>
<b>any new plan, or your personal goal.</b>

201
00:13:17.708 --> 00:13:23.416
<b>It is appropriate to share such </b>
<b>information only with those colleagues</b>

202
00:13:23.416 --> 00:13:25.708
<b>who are not only skilled,</b>

203
00:13:25.708 --> 00:13:26.625
<b>but</b>

204
00:13:26.625 --> 00:13:33.791
<b>also have genuine support for your personal </b>
<b>progress and the goals of the organization.</b>

205
00:13:33.791 --> 00:13:36.416
<b>Identify such colleagues</b>

206
00:13:36.416 --> 00:13:42.625
<b>who possess the qualities of trustworthiness, confidentiality and cooperation.</b>

207
00:13:42.625 --> 00:13:43.458
<b>Because</b>

208
00:13:43.458 --> 00:13:49.583
<b>only such people can give </b>
<b>positive advice, handle secrets,</b>

209
00:13:49.583 --> 00:13:54.625
<b>and also become collaborators</b>
<b>in your professional journey.</b>

210
00:13:54.625 --> 00:14:01.500
<b>Sharing your ideas with them </b>
<b>not only provides you guidance,</b>

211
00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.250
<b>but</b>

212
00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:07.375
<b>their enthusiasm also energizes you.</b>

213
00:14:07.375 --> 00:14:11.541
<b>Understanding the sensitivity of </b>
<b>any information at the workplace,</b>

214
00:14:11.541 --> 00:14:14.791
<b>giving it to only sufficient people.</b>

215
00:14:14.791 --> 00:14:19.583
<b>This is also a sign of your professional maturity.</b>

216
00:14:19.583 --> 00:14:26.666
<b>And this very understanding makes </b>
<b>you suitable for important tasks,</b>

217
00:14:26.666 --> 00:14:31.625
<b>which is also necessary for your progress.</b>

218
00:14:31.625 --> 00:14:32.916
<b>Remember,</b>

219
00:14:32.916 --> 00:14:38.625
<b>this does not mean ignoring or neglecting others.</b>

220
00:14:38.625 --> 00:14:40.291
<b>Respect everyone,</b>

221
00:14:40.291 --> 00:14:43.500
<b>build cordial relationships with all,</b>

222
00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:44.375
<b>but</b>

223
00:14:44.375 --> 00:14:47.416
<b>if the information is related to the organization,</b>

224
00:14:47.416 --> 00:14:53.208
<b>then more important than your </b>
<b>personal relationships and friendships,</b>

225
00:14:53.208 --> 00:14:57.000
<b>are the purpose and development </b>
<b>of that organization.</b>

226
00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.958
<b>In a professional setting, remember</b>

227
00:14:59.958 --> 00:15:01.583
<b>that sweetness can be shared with all,</b>

228
00:15:01.583 --> 00:15:02.458
<b>but</b>

229
00:15:02.458 --> 00:15:06.791
<b>confidentiality can be shared with only a few.</b>

230
00:15:06.791 --> 00:15:10.291
<b>The purpose is not to become mysterious,</b>

231
00:15:10.291 --> 00:15:14.875
<b>but only to work in the interest of the organization.</b>

232
00:15:14.875 --> 00:15:16.666
<b>Think about it.</b>

